# Drop facility photos here. Expected filenames (referenced in the page comments):
#   home-hero.jpg          — homepage hero (right side)
#   home-band-1.jpg        — homepage photo band: unit doors
#   home-band-2.jpg        — homepage photo band: tenant workshop
#   home-band-3.jpg        — homepage photo band: boat & RV parking
#   spaces-units.jpg       — Spaces page: drive-up unit row
#   spaces-workshop.jpg    — Spaces page: workshop interior
#   spaces-parking.jpg     — Spaces page: boat / RV parking
#   about-facility.jpg     — About page: the facility
#   about-family.jpg       — About page: the family / office
#
# To use one: open the page, find the matching <!-- Photo slot: ... --> comment,
# and replace the <div class="img-slot">...</div> with:
#   <img src="images/home-hero.jpg" alt="Short description of the photo">
